From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cloud-comms-engine <engine@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:51:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] repackage: applicationId com.mattermost.rnbeta ->
 com.diegonmarcos.comms.chat

Give the Cloud-Comms chat fork its OWN package id (constellation identity,
no collision with a real Mattermost install). google-services.json's beta
client package_name is changed to match so the com.google.gms.google-services
plugin still finds a matching client (else the build fails). namespace stays
com.mattermost.rnbeta (R/BuildConfig package + native code refs unchanged).
Push remains disabled (self-compiled apps need their own push service).
---
 android/app/build.gradle         | 2 +-
 android/app/google-services.json | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android/app/build.gradle b/android/app/build.gradle
index 5568b9d7f..a471d031f 100644
--- a/android/app/build.gradle
+++ b/android/app/build.gradle
@@ -112,7 +112,7 @@ android {
     }
 
     defaultConfig {
-        applicationId "com.mattermost.rnbeta"
+        applicationId "com.diegonmarcos.comms.chat"
         minSdkVersion rootProject.ext.minSdkVersion
         targetSdkVersion rootProject.ext.targetSdkVersion
         versionCode 749
diff --git a/android/app/google-services.json b/android/app/google-services.json
index 6b71b966d..eb6223e78 100644
--- a/android/app/google-services.json
+++ b/android/app/google-services.json
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
       "client_info": {
         "mobilesdk_app_id": "1:184930218130:android:c7debfa7ea3f75a7",
         "android_client_info": {
-          "package_name": "com.mattermost.rnbeta"
+          "package_name": "com.diegonmarcos.comms.chat"
         }
       },
       "oauth_client": [
